Epe
$cards
DECK 1 SPADES

$initial
GAEW 5 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
GAEW 8 FACE_LAST
GAEW 0 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE GAEW GAEW
OR
    DESTSRC Suit alternate_color
    AND
        DESTSRC Suit match
        DEST Suit {HEARTS, CLUBS, SPADES, DIAMONDS}
MOVE_STACK GAEW GAEW
SRCSTACK Suit match
$win
AND
    PILE ALL GAEW Empty
    PILE ALL GAEW Empty
